sequenceDiagram
    participant ParentAgent as all_model_agent
    participant PhysicalAgent as physical_modeller_agent
    participant SearchTools as Search Tools
    actor User

    ParentAgent->>PhysicalAgent: 1. "Create Physical Data Model"
    activate PhysicalAgent

    note over PhysicalAgent, SearchTools: 2. Agent uses context variables (e.g., logical_data_model) and calls search tools in parallel to gather information.

    PhysicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3a. call_bq_best_prac_search(...)
    PhysicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3b. extract_from_sql_queries(...)
    PhysicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3c. call_user_responses_search(...)
    note right of SearchTools: Other tools like ddl_search, google_search, etc., are also available and used as needed.
    
    activate SearchTools
    SearchTools-->>PhysicalAgent: 4. Return search results
    deactivate SearchTools
    
    note right of PhysicalAgent: 5. Agent synthesizes all inputs (context variables, search results) and generates the Physical Model artifact (BigQuery DDL scripts).

    PhysicalAgent-->>User: 6. "Here are the generated BigQuery DDL scripts. Please review."
    
    PhysicalAgent->>PhysicalAgent: 7. Calls 'save_output' tool to save the generated artifact to a file (e.g., physical_data_model.sql).
    
    alt User provides feedback by uploading a file
        User->>PhysicalAgent: 8a. Uploads modified file.
        PhysicalAgent->>PhysicalAgent: 9a. Calls 'read_input' tool to process the uploaded file as the new source of truth.
    else User provides verbal go-ahead
        User->>PhysicalAgent: 8b. "Looks good, proceed."
    end

    PhysicalAgent-->>ParentAgent: 10. Returns final result and completion status.
    deactivate PhysicalAgent
